Falsifies `non_volatile_memory_express::verification::completion_decode_is_total_and_rebuilds_dword_three`.

The defect: `Completion::from_dwords` reads the status field from bit 16, one bit low, so the phase tag
becomes the status's lowest bit and every fresh completion on the first lap looks like an error.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(completion.status < 1 << 15)`.

diff --git a/src/completion.rs b/src/completion.rs
--- a/src/completion.rs
+++ b/src/completion.rs
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@
             submission_queue_id: (dwords[2] >> 16) as u16,
             command_id: dwords[3] as u16,
             phase: Self::is_phase_tag_set(dwords[3]),
-            status: (dwords[3] >> 17) as u16,
+            status: (dwords[3] >> 16) as u16,
         }
     }
 
